+
+positional arguments:
+  {task,pill,ritual,board,atom,materialization,repository,inbox-note,faq-doc,step}
+    task                Create an actionable task bundle.
+    pill                Create a pill artifact.
+    ritual              Create a ritual artifact.
+    board               Create a board artifact.
+    atom                Create a atom artifact.
+    materialization     Create a materialization artifact.
+    repository          Create a local repository artifact doc; use 'deskops repo register' for canonical ecosystem registration.
+    inbox-note          Create a inbox-note artifact.
+    faq-doc             Create a faq-doc artifact.
+    step                Create a step artifact.
+
+options:
+  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
+
+Examples:
+  deskops add task --root . --title "Fix thing" --goal "..." --scope "..." --validation "pytest"
+  deskops add pill --root . --title "Guardrail: Keep layers clean" --what "..." --why "..."
diff --git a/tests/fixtures/golden/help/deskops_add_atom.txt b/tests/fixtures/golden/help/deskops_add_atom.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..61f8110
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/fixtures/golden/help/deskops_add_atom.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+usage: deskops add atom [-h] [--root ROOT] [--from-yaml FROM_YAML]
+                        [--title TITLE]
+                        --five-wh-one-plus {what,why,how,how_not,when,where,for_whom}
+                        --answer ANSWER [--tags TAGS [TAGS ...]]
+                        [--provenance PROVENANCE]
+
+Create a atom artifact.
+
+options:
+  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
+  --root ROOT           Target repository root.
+  --from-yaml FROM_YAML
+                        Load the atom payload from a YAML file.
+  --title TITLE         Short, descriptive title for the atomic knowledge unit.
+  --five-wh-one-plus {what,why,how,how_not,when,where,for_whom}
+                        The single 5WH1+ question this atom answers: one of what, why, how, how_not, when, where, for_whom.
+  --answer ANSWER       The curated raw answer to the selected 5WH1+ question, written as one stable knowledge unit.
+  --tags TAGS [TAGS ...]
+                        Namespaced semantic tags used for retrieval and grouping, each in the form namespace:value (e.g. system:deskops, topic:templates). Tags do not encode lifecycle, relations, evidence, or materialization.
+  --provenance PROVENANCE
+                        Optional URL or path to the authoritative source of this atom's knowledge. Used for traceability and provenance tracking.
+
+Example:
+  deskops add atom --root . --title "Example"
